      "@type": "rec:KPIAnalysis",
      "rec:query": "Grow revenue",
      "rec:summary": "The KPIs REVIEW_SCORE and IS_NEGATIVE_REVIEW provide diagnostic evidence for customer retention, which is a factor in revenue growth. REVIEW_SCORE offers insight into customer satisfaction levels, while IS_NEGATIVE_REVIEW specifically identifies negative feedback (scores \u22642), both of which are indicators of customer loyalty and the likelihood of repeat business.",
